        "text": "Continuity stores repository changes in a write-ahead log.",
        "issue": "ASD-STE100 Issue 9",
        "reviewStatus": "draft"
      },
      "sourceIds": [
        "article"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "storage-doc",
      "title": "Object storage",
      "plain": "The article identifies S3 as the production object store. The context shows this as an external dependency.",
